                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Exarch Power" typeId="c400-873f-536b-90d7">All the Exarch&apos;s foes count double the value of any fumbles. When they roll a 1 on the attack dice this adds +2 to the Exarch&apos;s combat score rather than the usual +1</characteristic>
