                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">May leap 4&quot; in addition to regular movement during the move phase. Can be used when charging as well. Can only leap once during the turn.
Can use the leap to jump over any model-high obstacle without penalty, including enemy models. 
Can leap out of close combat at the end of any close combat phase without suffering any penalty</characteristic>
